#AUTHORS Tyrst  ~

#HELPS
-1 WYVERNS_TOWER_CHANGES~
01.10.05 - Added color and effects to the Obelisk. (Mag)
~
-1 'WYVERNS TOWER' WYVERN~
WYVERN'S TOWER
This tower, situated north-east of Chakkor, was once
occupied by a garrison from a long gone civilization.  At 
some time in the past, though, it was destroyed and then inhabited 
by a great wyvern.  As time passed both evil and good creatures 
have come to live in and about the tower.  You may find that one 
group or the other wishes to be rid of its neighbors.
    
     (a) Credits

{a}WYVERNCREDITS
~
-1 WYVERNCREDITS~
WYVERN'S TOWER CREDITS
This Area was originally designed by Tyrst.
~
0 $~

